  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Simply put, make it possible to use PC keyboards and keyboard shortcuts usable when a person is in VR. It would be great to be able to use my keyboard while I'm using my Index. By this I don't mean just for URL inputs for video players. There have been a few instances where I have enter a world that lags so bad, I can't open my menu while in VR. I wish I could just use escape to open my menu or have a keyboard shortcut to return to my home-world. \n\nAlso, additionally it would be great to have a keyboard shortcut to reset fullbody out of convenience. \n\nThese are my suggestions for now. This suggestion is simple and could be convenient for other players.",
